              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Modern Digo weddings are changing. The months-long bridal preparation has shortened. The bride price negotiations, while still important, may be conducted more quickly and with less ceremony than in the past. Some young couples choose civil or Islamic weddings without the full traditional ceremony. Urban weddings may feature DJ systems alongside the traditional ngoma drums."
