              "text": "Base Titanium committed to a land rehabilitation program as part of its mining license conditions. The process involves replacing topsoil, replanting vegetation, and restoring the mined-out areas to a condition that can support some form of productive use. The company has reported progress on rehabilitation of completed mining sections, and some areas have been replanted with fast-growing tree species and ground cover."
